# Section 20: contact form service configuration
# Point this at a form/email service that accepts a POST of JSON and
# returns a 2xx response — e.g. Formspree (https://formspree.io) or
# Getform (https://getform.io), or your own serverless function.
#
# Example (Formspree): https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
